and he says um someone who's an inquirer not knowing how to gauge another's mind in other words how to read another's mind another's heart should make an investigation of the targeter in order to find out whether or not he's fully awakened so remember the word targeter was how he referred to himself um you can translate it as um uh the transcendent one gone there right that's how it translates

