82
00:10:07,671 --> 00:10:18,663
He places confidence in the teacher, thus the Blessed One is fully enlightened, the Dharma is well proclaimed by the Blessed One, and the Sangha is practicing the good way.

83
00:10:20,083 --> 00:10:21,725
Now, if others should ask you,

84
00:10:22,009 --> 00:10:29,720
What are the Venerable One's reason and what is his evidence that the Blessed One is fully enlightened, etc., etc.?

85
00:10:30,780 --> 00:10:36,628
They should answer, Here, friends, I approached the Blessed One in order to hear the Dharma.

86
00:10:36,648 --> 00:10:45,799
The Blessed One taught me the Dharma with its higher and higher levels, with its more and more sublime levels, with its dark and bright counterparts.

87
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:50,245
As the Blessed One taught the Dharma to me in this way, through direct knowledge,

88
00:10:50,495 --> 00:11:02,393
of a certain teaching here in that dharma, I came to the conclusion that I am under teachings and I place confidence in the Buddha.

89
00:11:02,413 --> 00:11:18,155
Now, when anyone's faith has been planted, rooted and established in the Tathagata through these reasons, terms and phrases, his faith is said to be supported by reasons rooted in vision and firm.

